<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:32:56 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">3 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Jang đu pe</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Jang</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Jn</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Jang</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Takóh bhươl pagơơi đóng Gaai-uut nh'nhơr bơk, manưih đu aku nh'nhơr kalóóng paraaq dhalam.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Anó aku nh'nhơr, kalóóng dyóp rau, aku gavơh nhan đóng amei bâân karvaan kabhôôq, tơk mơ ve phơn achak mamông karơ dhiêp kơi phơn ravaai amei dyơq bâân karvaan kabhôôq. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Taai aku lóng tagah bhuui marhaal xók nôôq adhi anó tơk lơq truuih đuui rau lalua leq amei, ting pakơi amei biêh dyơq jađaang vôôiq kalóóng paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Aku kah ve lóóm bhuui n'đó gamak lơh nôôq rau ađô, ađek nek aku ve bâân xâng akóón anaaq ưng ađêi dyơq jađaang vôôiq kalóóng paraaq dhalam.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Anó aku nh'nhơr, amei dyơq matêêng kalóóng lóóm huuiq dhơ dharau đu amei ve chóóm têêng đóng nôôq adhi anó, tơk mơ rau ađek đóng nôôq tamóói chrih, <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />nek nôôq manưih ơi truuih đuui leq lóóm tanhơr ưng amei toom mat akóón dhơn Chuôq. Amei e têêng kơi bhơt lóóm xók ting chalaang piđó yuur vôôiq ting kơi targlap palơq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />tââq piđó ơi yuur vôôiq taai Dhanóók achêk, xók kah đơơp marau marâ tââq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Hayơq nôôq he kơng phaai pơh yaauq nôôq manưih kơi achêk, đóng nôôq he xar vaaih nôôq manưih ting têêng tarnêêng đóng paraaq dhalam.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Aku ơi xaraq bơơr pe paraaq đóng akóón dhơn Chuôq, bơơi Đi-ô-treep, đu kiêng têêng akoq dyóp ngaai, kah đơơp đươi nôôq yi. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Ơi taai rau ađô, la aku tơk, aku e chamet lêi nôôq tarnêêng ưng ađó ađek đu ađó ađek dyơq têêng xók baauq uôn nôôq yi palơq nôôq paraaq aak môôp. Lơq xók biêh kah ơi iêm lóóm palơq nôôq tarnêêng ađek, ađó achêk kah đơơp pơh yaauq nôôq adhi anó, hayơq ađó ađek kung gróóng kajơq nôôq ngaai ve lóóm pơh yaauq lơq chuih piđó gluh tââq akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="3JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Anó aku nh'nhơr, óóq ting đuui rau môôp, bơơi phaai ting đuui rau liêm. Ngaai têêng liêm nek mađó leq Yaang Pleng; đu têêng môôp nek kah ơi glêh lêi Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="3JN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Đê-mê-triiu bâân paraaq truuih liêm tââq dyóp ngaai manưih lơq tââq chênh paraaq dhalam. Mat lââng, nôôq yi kung truuih đuui dyơq, lơq amei n'nal kơi paraaq truuih ưng nôôq yi nek rau lalua.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Aku ve bơk rau kiêng xaraq đóng amei, bơơi aku kah kiêng pei mưk lơq kabhiêk đóng xaraq leq amei. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Bơơi aku rââm đâh tarlum amei, lơq nôôq he e praaq chiên mat talêi mat. <verse eid="3JN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Nhan rau yươq rauha tơơt palơq amei. Nôôq parjơơk dhiq ađô tamóh tham amei. Nhan pagơơi paraaq tamóh tham nôôq parjơơk dhiq ađek chanót ting chanak manưih.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>